{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q4002572","formula":"AgMnPb₃Sb₅S₁₂","hill":"AgMnPb3S12Sb5","elements":["S","Mn","Ag","Sb","Pb"],"composition":{"S":12.0,"Ag":1.0,"Mn":1.0,"Pb":3.0,"Sb":5.0},"names":{"en":"Uchucchacuaite","uk":"Учукчакуаїт"},"descriptions":{"en":"Uchucchacuaite (AgMnPb3Sb5S12) is a rare sulfosalt mineral found in hydrothermal deposits. It was first described in 1984 for an occurrence in the Uchucchacua Mine, Oyon Province, Lima Department, Peru, and named for the mine. It has also been reported from mines in Hokkaido, Japan.","uk":"Учукчакуаїт (AgMnPb3Sb5S12) — рідкісний мінерал, сульфосіль, знайдений у гідротермальних родовищах. Вперше його було описано в 1984 році у срібно-цинковій копальні «Учук-Чакуа» однойменного родовища, провінція Ойон, Ліма, Перу, і названо на честь родовища. Повідомлялося також про знахідки у копальнях Хоккайдо, Японія."},"fame":9,"pubchemCid":null,"mass":null,"charge":0,"smiles":null,"inchikey":null,"iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q12089225","names":{"en":"mineral species","ru":"действительный вид минералов","uk":"мінеральний вид"}}],"structureInfo":null,"structure":null,"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q4002572","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uchucchacuaite","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (uk)","url":"https://uk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A3%D1%87%D1%83%D0%BA%D1%87%D0%B0%D0%BA%D1%83%D0%B0%D1%97%D1%82","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"photo","name":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Uchucchacuaite.jpg","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q415818","formula":"Pb₄FeSb₆S₁₄","names":{"en":"Jamesonite","ru":"Джемсонит","uk":"Джемсоніт"},"elements":["S","Fe","Sb","Pb"],"fame":29,"kind":"crystal"},{"id":"Q3887754","formula":"Ag₃Pb₁₀Sb₁₁S₂₈","names":{"en":"Owyheeite","uk":"Овіхіїт"},"elements":["S","Ag","Sb","Pb"],"fame":5,"kind":null},